      "value": "same issue, recent vrc update increased cpu usage & cpu frametime drastically (almost twice), even in default vrc home world i experience micro stutters & frame drops like every 30 seconds & one of the cpu's cores spikes to 100% utilisation (so this is not the user's generated content causing frame drops cause world is empty & not like overloaded with particles, meshes & etc.).\n\nPc config (if this issue ever will be rewieved):\n\nCpu: R7 5800X3D (water cooling nzxt kracken X 240, no thermal throttle in vrc)\n\nMobo: gigabyte X570 Aorus pro\n\nRam: Thermaltake toughram xg 3600 MHz 64 gig (2x32)\n\nGpu: 4070 ti super (Palit gaming pro oc)\n\nPsu: be quiet straight power 11 1000w platinum (so not the power issue)\n\nVr specs:\n\nVive Pro Eye + Vive facial tracker, 10p vive fbt (3 - 2.0 trackers, 4 - 3.0), index controllers",
